    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Letters and messages",
     "texto": [
      "**邮件** is an email or electronic message; **邮箱** is the mailbox or email account where emails are received. To count letters you use the measure word **封**: **一封信** = one letter.",
      "**发生** means «to happen»; **发现**, which you learned before, means «to discover». They look alike in form, but they don't mean the same thing."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
